From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mf: Audio capture source, tee nodes, PMP session, transcode profile.

MFCreateDeviceSource/MFCreateDeviceSourceActivate create WASAPI audio
capture sources (symbolic links, endpoint roles, stream descriptors,
start/stop/pause, samples from the capture client). The media session
supports tee nodes (outputs requested and delivered, format changes),
UpdateNodeAttributes, drops queued transform events on flush and flushes
when seeking from pause. MFCreatePMPMediaSession and a PMP server
(in-process), MFCreateTranscodeProfile, MFTranscodeGetAudioOutputAvailableTypes,
MFCreateWMAEncoderActivate/MFCreateWMVEncoderActivate. The EVR's
IMFQualityAdvise keeps drop mode and quality level, the copier sizes audio
buffers and reports cbSize only with an input type, topologies return media
type counts. include/mfidl.idl gets the missing declarations. Removes two
todo_wine marks of the mf tests.
